  "evidence_passages": [
    "“At μ_b = 4.8 GeV the SM Wilson coefficients relevant for b→sℓℓ are C9 ≃ 4.07 and C10 ≃ −4.31.”",
    "“The Standard Model values (at the b‑scale) are C7 ≃ −0.29, C9 ≃ 4.2 and C10 ≃ −4.3.”"
  ],
  "sources": [
    "A. J. Buras, F. De Fazio, J. Girrbach-Noe and P. Krawczyk, example compilation of SM Wilson coefficients — see e.g. A. Altmannshofer & D. M. Straub, arXiv:1503.06199 (review of b→sℓℓ phenomenology) https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.06199",
    "Review/phenomenology papers listing SM baseline values, e.g. S. Descotes‑Genon et al., and standard flavour EFT references summarised in reviews such as arXiv:1307.5683 (Descotes‑Genon et al.) and related B‑physics reviews that quote C9 ≃ 4.1 and C10 ≃ −4.3."
  ]
